 "stimulus_html": "<p>“Equality of rights under the law shall not be denied or abridged by the United States or by any state on account of sex.”</p>\n<p align=\"right\">The proposed Equal Rights Amendment to the U.S. Constitution</p>\n<p><i>Refer to the excerpt provided.</i></p>\n",
